<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TI" style="id">- Saafi-Saafi</book>
  <para style="h">2 Timoote</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Ti</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Timoote</para>
  <para style="toc1">Fiisi Pool kanakɗoh kaɓɗoh Timoote</para>
  <para style="mt">Fiisi Pool kanakɗoh kaɓɗoh Timoote</para>
  <para style="is">Rangsohaani</para>
  <para style="ip">Pool ɓaahee ŋ Israayel ci, ŋ cuuɓiŋ Benyaamin.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:1">Ɓi Rom 11:1</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:5">Ɓi Filippi 3:5</ref></char></note> A nikee <char style="w"><char style="tl">Farisen</char></char>.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:6">Tum ci 23:6</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:5">Ɓi Filippi 3:5</ref></char></note> Ŋ finho <char style="w">Paantakot</char>, wi Janguuni camb ɓaatuk, a ɓaahee ŋ ɓi tolfiɗee kosiɗ ci.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:58-8:3">Tum ci 7:58–8:3</ref></char></note> Waaye wa raakka mbeh, a cohha na Yeesu, a kossa<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:1-30">Tum ci 9:1-30</ref></char></note> po a nikka <char style="w"><char style="tl">Apootar</char></char> sah. Teerndiŋ "Tum ciŋ <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ci" teeɓohiɗ pangkiŋ ɗe wi a nik <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ini kooɗoh ŋ saar 13.</para>
  <para style="ip">Wa miniɗ nik ne Pool hotiɗ Timoote ŋ ɗooƴ ɓaaɓaŋ ɗe yakka koc, wa a nik ŋ Listar na Derbe<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 14:6-7">Tum ci 14:6-7</ref></char></note>. Tiikiŋ Timoote koc woyu ŋ ɗooƴ ɓaaɓaŋ Pool yakka kanakɗoh.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:1-5">Tum ci 16:1-5</ref></char></note> Weem raak ɗe kosiɗ te a nikee ndaam.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ini kooɗoh ndeem, Timoote ɓaahee ŋ ɓi hunee na Pool. Timoote meeɗeen ɓaaɓ in laayiɗ findi wi a wikee fiis ci Pool kaɓɗohee wala cum ɗah a nikiɗ Pool ŋ ɗisik.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:1-5">Tum ci 16:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 17:4-16">17:4-16</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 18:5">18:5</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 19:22">19:22</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 20:4">20:4</ref></char></note> Pool seede'iɗ Timoote seede moɗiɗ ŋ fiisi a kaɓɗoh ɓi Filippi.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 2:19-22">Ɓi Filippi 2:19-22</ref></char></note> Marka tiikiŋ Timoote ŋ Limiŋ tiik ci.</para>
  <para style="ip">"Fiisi Pool koc kaɓɗoh Timoote" wa fiisu ŋ finho "Tum ciŋ <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ci", mbaa raakiɗ in laayiɗ ci ɓo' inahɗi nga, waaye ɓoo inhiɗ ne wa raak Pool nikisɗi ŋ kaso te Timoote nikee ŋ Efes.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 1:3">1 Timoote 1:3</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 3:14">3:14</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="ip">Wi Pool na fiise "Fiisi a kanakɗoh kaɓɗoh Timoote" wii, wa tel ɗe doknissuuɗ ŋ kasoonaŋ <char style="w">Rom</char>, raak wa wooriɗ ne a hey atte'se ne a apu.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 2:9">2 Timoote 2:9</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:6-8">4:6-8</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="ip">Ŋ kaɓɗohi a fiis Timoote wii, a ñaahiɗ ɗe ŋ in laayiɗ te a teeɓpa ɗe in ci a joy wortuk, a woosa ɗe ne a hayaat gaaw ne a hot ɗe bala a kaanan ɗah.</para>
  <para style="iot">Fiisi Pool kanakɗoh kaɓɗoh Timoote kaɗtiɗoh an :</para>
  <para style="io1">- Pool kañɗiɗ Timoote, te a corkiɗta Kooh ŋ ini kaɗ nga ɗe <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TI 1:1-5">1:1-5</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Pool ɓaatiɗ Timoote fit <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TI 1:3-11">1:3-11</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Pool ñaahiɗ Timoote ne a taambiɗ <char style="w" lemma="Kiristaa">Kiristaani</char> <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TI 2:1-14">2:1-14</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Pool ñaahiɗ Timoote ne a tum panguk baahiɗ <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TI 1:18-3:15">1:18–3:15</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Findi ɓooɓi mandan ŋ jamanooci mirndohan <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TI 3:1-9">3:1-9</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Pool ñaahiɗ Timoote ne a taamb ŋ kot ciŋ ɗe <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TI 3:10-17">3:10-17</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Pool ñaahiɗ Timoote ne a taalndiɗ a yegɗohee <char style="w">Yegɗohiŋ Muci</char>. <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TI 4:1-8">4:1-8</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Nakoh ci mirndoh na Askohi <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TI 4:9-22">4:9-22</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TI 1"/>
  <para style="s">Kañɗohi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="2TI 1:1-2"/>Mi yii kañiɗ ɗa, Timoote, mi yi Pool, <char style="tl"><char style="w" lemma="apootar">Apootariŋ</char></char> <char style="w" lemma="Kiristaa">Kiristaani</char> Yeesu. Ŋ tumuuɗ <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ŋ waaɗ-waaɗiŋ Kooh ne ŋ yegɗoh gapohiŋ kipes ki nik ŋ Kiristaani Yeesu. Mi yii fiis kaytii ne ŋ woo na ɗa Timoote, kuɓkiŋ ngo ŋ keeñkoh. Kooh yi Baabi baahohaat ɗa, a yirmaat ɗa, a on ɗa jam ; Kiristaani Yeesu Heɗ ɓoo baahohaat ɗa, a yirmaat ɗa, a on ɗa jam.<verse eid="2TI 1:1-2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pool corkiɗiɗ Kooh sagu Timoote</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 1:3"/>Kooh, yi mi na ñaamke na hel daliɗ findi ɓooɓi rim mbo na caacuuciŋ ngo, mi na genee ɗe corkiɗ nga ɗa ; ŋ ɓekee tiikiŋ ɗa ŋ kiim ciŋ ngo wek na noh. <verse eid="2TI 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 1:4"/>Mi yii naandsuk muhun caŋ ɗa, ŋ mariɗ ɗa hot lool, ne ŋ riif na sum. <verse eid="2TI 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 1:5"/>Mi yii naandsuk kosi keeh-keehi nik nga ɗa. Koseem kockoh ŋ caac fu ɓitiɓ Loyiis na yaay ɗu Onis, te wa wooriɗ to ne weɗi nammba nik nga ɗa.<verse eid="2TI 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pool ñaahiɗ Timoote</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 1:6"/>Ineem weɗ tah mi yii naandis ɗa ne fu humbis ini Kooh tum nga ɗa findi jaal yongkaah, ini fu rahas wa ŋ deg ɗa yaah ciŋ ngo. <verse eid="2TI 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 1:7"/>Kooh eɗɗi ɓoo fuuɗsi tuman ɓoo neek, waaye a eɗ ɓoo <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi</char> riifɗan ɓoo na hatil na waaɗoh na amb haf ɓoo. <verse eid="2TI 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 1:8"/>Kon nak kina supuk seede ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ Heɗ ɓoo, te kinaa so supuk mi yi ambu saguuce. Waaye, ngaŋ hatiliŋ Kooh, ɓaaha na so miskiɗi sagu <char style="w">Yegɗohiŋ Muci</char>.<verse eid="2TI 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 1:9"/>Wa cariɗa keeh-keeh, laam Kooh mucɗiɗ ɓoo te a ɓeeɗkiɗ ɓoo ne ɓoo nik ɓo' hooliɗ wuu ce. A tumɗi ineem sagu in ci ɓoo tum, waaye a tuma ŋ ini neɓ ɗe ne a baahoh ɓoo ; a baahohiɗ ɓoo ŋ niki ɓoo nik ŋ Kiristaani Yeesu, bala Adina nikan. <verse eid="2TI 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 1:10"/>Baahoheem hotkiɗ kotii, wi Kiristaani Yeesu, Mucɗohi hay. A yi fol hatiliŋ kakaan, a taamboh ŋ Yegɗohiŋ Muci a eɗ ɓoo, a teeɓohha kipes ki kakaan miniɗɗi in.<verse eid="2TI 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 1:11"/>Ne ŋ teeɓoh muceem, weɗ tah po Kooh tummba so yegɗohoh na <char style="tl">Apootar</char> na jangɗohoh. <verse eid="2TI 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 1:12"/>Ineem weɗ tah po ŋ raakee miskiɗ woti. Waaye ŋ supukɗi nga, laam ŋ inhiɗ Yi ŋ kos te wa wooriɗ to ne a raakiɗ hatili a niiɗohan ini a dengkoh ho po ŋ mbehaŋ atteena. <verse eid="2TI 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 1:13"/>Marka ŋ woo ci keeh ci fu kerhoh nga so. Fu tiindɗoh ca kosi na waaɗohiŋ ɓi nik ŋ Kiristaani Yeesu. <verse eid="2TI 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 1:14"/>Taambkoha in ci baahiɗ ci Kooh dengkoh ɗa, taamboh ŋ <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char> nik nga ɓoo.<verse eid="2TI 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 1:15"/>Fu inhiɗ ne ɓiŋ kur caŋ Asi jen faɗiɗ to, te Fijel na Hermojen ɓaah ŋ ɓooɓeem. <verse eid="2TI 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 1:16"/>Onesifoor nak, Heɗi yirmaat ɓi kahan ce, a meeɗ to meeɗ ɓaatɗoh, te a supkeeɗi ceen ciŋ ngo. <verse eid="2TI 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 1:17"/>Waaye kay, wa a ree <char style="w">Rom</char> rek, a waakeeɗa so ɗisik nu ɗisik po a hotta so. <verse eid="2TI 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 1:18"/>A miskaat Heɗi ŋ mbehaŋ atteena ! A fu uup inah pangki a panguk ŋ Efes jen.<verse eid="2TI 1:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TI 2"/>
  <para style="s">Soldaariŋ Kiristaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 2:1"/>Ini kaɗ nga ɗa kuɓkiŋ ngo Timoote, ɓaatka hatil ŋ baahohi Kooh baahoh ɗa, ŋ niki fu nik ŋ <char style="w" lemma="Kiristaa">Kiristaani</char> Yeesu. <verse eid="2TI 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 2:2"/>Ini fu kerah ho jangɗoheeɗa ŋ fiki seede laayiɗ, dengkohaa ɓi ɓo' oolkuuɗ, ɓi namana min jangiɗ ɓi ɓo' wiiriis. <verse eid="2TI 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 2:3"/>Teyɗuka ɓakiŋ ɗa ŋ miskiɗi findi soldaar baahiɗ ŋ soldaar ciŋ Kiristaani Yeesu.<verse eid="2TI 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 2:4"/>Soldaar waaɗ ne yi adgoh ɗe neɓu nga ɗe ɗah, a taambkohanɗi in ciŋ kipes ki. <verse eid="2TI 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 2:5"/>Te leberoh waaɗ saah ɗah, a hey taambe in ci leber nakoh. <verse eid="2TI 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 2:6"/>Panguk guuroh miskiɗ lool, tahha po a yi joy koc rahas ɓakiŋ ɗe ŋ ruundiɗ ci. <verse eid="2TI 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 2:7"/>Liiɓa baahiɗ ŋ ini ŋ woo ɗa, Heɗi hey ɗa one fu min inah in ci ŋ woo ceem jen.<verse eid="2TI 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Naandsuka Yeesu Kiristaa yi hulit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 2:8"/>Liiɓa ŋ Yeesu Kiristaa, findi ŋ yegɗohee ɗu wa wi ŋ woyee ɗu <char style="w">Yegɗohiŋ Muci</char>. A puloh ŋ cuuɓiŋ Dawuuda, a kaaniɗ, a hultiɗuusa. <verse eid="2TI 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 2:9"/>Yegɗoheem weɗ tah ho raak miskiɗ po ŋ ceenu haa tumoh moɗaaɗi. Waaye woo kiŋ Kooh ceenuuɗi. <verse eid="2TI 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 2:10"/>Weɗ tah ho muñee miskiɗ ci jen sagu ɓooɓi Kooh kooɗ ne ɓa min rahas muci ŋ niki ɓa nik ŋ Kiristaani Yeesu ; ɓa nam yakɗu po faw.<verse eid="2TI 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 2:11"/>Woo kii wooriɗ :</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2TI 2:11"/>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:11">Ɓoo kaan na ɗe ɗah,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:11">ɓoo hey pese na ɗe.<verse eid="2TI 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 2:12"/>Ɓoo muñ ndengɗukee ɗah,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:12">ɓoo hey nguurke na ɗe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:12">Ɓoo taasuk ɗe ɗah,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:12">a hey ɓoo name taasuk.<verse eid="2TI 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 2:13"/>Ɓoo faɗ ini ɓoo woo ɗah,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:13">a risan tum ini a woo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:13">laam a minɗi taas haf ce.<verse eid="2TI 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 2:14"/>In ceem ceɗ fu joy naandsoh. Ŋ fiki Kooh, woya ɓi na taastiɗohe ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ toksiŋ woo ci, ɓa faɗ ineem. Wa raakɗi njiriñ, ɗal yahroh ɓi na sikɗuke.<verse eid="2TI 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pangkohi neɓ Kooh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 2:15"/>Ndengɗuka po fu neɓ Kooh findi pangkoh baahiɗ, yi na supkeeɗi ŋ ini a na haɓɗe, yi na jangɗohe hooliɗ woo kiŋ keeh ki.<verse eid="2TI 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 2:16"/>Kina ɓaah ŋ woo mbalay, ci hunɗi na kos. Ɓi na tume ineem uupan uup us Kooh. <verse eid="2TI 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 2:17"/>Woo ciŋ ɓa mandan na puusi minɗi faɗ wi na ɓaatke ɓaatuk kaɗe. Himene na Fileet ɓaah ŋ ɓooɓeem. <verse eid="2TI 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 2:18"/>Ɓa usiɗ keeh ki ŋ ini ɓa na woye ne kosiɗ ci hultiɗ po ƴutiɗ ; ŋ ineem ɓa ɗii yahroh kosiŋ ɓum.<verse eid="2TI 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 2:19"/>Waaye ɓooɓi Kooh tufkiɗ, kosiŋ ɓa ndengiɗ tir findi atoh ci raan taɓah. Woo kii fiisuusa nga ca : « Heɗi inhiɗ ɓi a raak.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 16:5">Kind ci 16:5</ref></char></note> » Na woo kii : « Ɓo' nu woo ne a ɓaah ŋ Heɗi ɗah, a wortukaat in nu nik in baahaaɗi ɗah ! »<verse eid="2TI 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 2:20"/>Ŋ ɗooƴ kahan yakiɗ, e pangkoha haɓɗohuuɗ urus na haalis dong nik nga haa, wa namiɗ raak pangkoha haɓɗohuuɗ ndooɗ na ɗok. Cum njirñiɗkoha ŋ ceeke, cum njirñiɗkoha ŋ in ci ƴin ƴin ci. <verse eid="2TI 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 2:21"/>Ɓo' nu hooliɗ haf ce ŋ in ci baahaaɗiici ɗah, a mandan na pangkohaani hoolɗu wuu Kooh, wi eɗu cir. A hey raakɗe heɗ ce njiriñ, te a hey mine panguk panguk baahiɗ nu nik.<verse eid="2TI 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 2:22"/>Nupa waaɗ-waaɗ ci baahaaɗiici kikomaaki na waaɗɗukohee ɗa. Ndengɗuka po fu nik ɓo' yurhiɗ, fu min oolku, fu waaɗ ɓooɓi, fu raak jam na ɓa. Pesoha ɗaa na ɓi na kiime Heɗi na keeñ hooliɗ. <verse eid="2TI 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2TI 2:23"/>Sanga taastiɗoh ci naandohaaci, dofohaaci, fu inhiɗ ne ca na ɓeke lahtoh. <verse eid="2TI 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2TI 2:24"/>Te <char style="w" lemma="ñaam">ñaamiŋ</char> Heɗi joyɗi lahtoh. A joy joy baah ŋ ɓooɓi jen, a min jangɗoh, a min muñɗoh ; <verse eid="2TI 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2TI 2:25"/>a kuƴsee ɓi na taasee ɗe na yeeɓuk, ya ɓa inah andi Kooh onanɗi ɓa ɓa ɓoƴsoh pesohaaɗ po ɓa inah keeh ki. <verse eid="2TI 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2TI 2:26"/>Ŋ ineem ɓa hey dokke ŋ sagoociŋ ɓa, ɓa fus ŋ fiir ciŋ Seytaani yi ambee ɓa ñaam te a tumɗukoheeɗa ɓa waaɗ-waaɗiŋ ɗe.<verse eid="2TI 2:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TI 3"/>
  <para style="s">Findi ɓooɓi mandan ŋ jamanooci mirndohan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 3:1"/>Inha inii baahiɗ, Timoote : Ŋ mbeh ci mirndohan, jamano hey miske. <verse eid="2TI 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 3:2"/>Ɓooɓi waaɗan haf ciŋ ɓa dong, ɓa waaɗ kopor, ɓa waaɗ teeɓohuk, ɓa waaɗ hotsiɗuk ; ɓa nikan ɗaloh Kooh, ɓa kerhiɗanɗi ɓi rim ɓa, ɓa inhanɗi corkiɗoh te ɓa eɗissanɗi cir in ciŋ Kooh. <verse eid="2TI 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 3:3"/>Ɓa hey suusse keeñ, ɓa waaɗanɗi jam, ɓa nikan yahoh tiik, ɓa minanɗi amb haf ɓa, ɓa nikan añaandiɗ te ɓa sang in baahiɗ. <verse eid="2TI 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 3:4"/>Ɓa nikan woroh, ɓa nik ɓo' yeeɓkaaɗi'iɗ, ɓa yaksiɗuk lool, e waaɗi ɓa waaɗ kiñin ciŋ ɓa ngisohɗan ɓa waaɗ Kooh.<verse eid="2TI 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 3:5"/>Ɓa nikan ɓo' kosiɗ ŋ has ciŋ ɓooɓi, waaye raakan ɓa faɗiɗ hatili nik ŋ kosi. Ɓooɓeem, usaa ɓa !<verse eid="2TI 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 3:6"/>Raakiɗ nga ɓa ɓi na kaɗe ŋ kahan ci, ɓa ñaañohee ɓitiɓ ci yooɓ ñaañohu, ɓi fu inah ne ɓa ɓitiɗ dis na bakaaɗ, ɓa minɗi saɓsukoh na waak in neɓiɗ nu nik <verse eid="2TI 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 3:7"/>te ɓa na gene jang waaye ɓa moosanɗi min inhisoh keeh ki.<verse eid="2TI 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 3:8"/>Ñaañohoh ceem mand na Janes na Jamberes<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Janes na Jamberes </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: wa nikee mbaah ŋ Yawuut ci, ɓa naandsukeesa ini naandsuku ŋ teerndiŋ </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 7:11-12">Pula 7:11-12</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 7:22">22</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 8:7">8:7</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 8:18">18</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 8:19">19</ref></char> ɗah, ɓa na ɓeeɗkohe luhusoh ci nik ŋ naandsukeem Janes na Jamberes. </note> ɓi hiñohee <char style="w">Musaa</char>. Ɓooɓeem na hiñohe na keeh ki, liiɓohaaciŋ ɓa yahkiɗ te kosiŋ ɓa kos haa. <verse eid="2TI 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 3:9"/>Waaye ɓa kaɗanɗi usiɗ, naand kiŋ ɓa hey hotke ŋ fiki ɓooɓi jen findi wa raakohee ŋ Janes na Jamberes.<verse eid="2TI 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pool dengiɗ Timoote ne yeem ris ŋ kosi a kos</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 3:10"/>Waaye fu nak, fu kerhiɗ jangɗohiŋ ngo baahiɗ, fu markiɗ baahiɗ findi maa pesohe, na ini tah ho kuruk, na kosiŋ ngo, na findi maa muñohe, na waaɗi ŋ waaɗ ɓooɓi, na maañi ŋ maañ ndengɗuk. <verse eid="2TI 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 3:11"/>Fu hotiɗ tolfiɗ ci ŋ tolfiɗu na miskiɗ ci ŋ muñ ŋ Añcos-Pisidi na Ikoñum na Listar. Raakɗi tolfiɗi ŋ tolfiɗuuɗi. Te Heɗi pulɗohiɗ to nga ca jen.<verse eid="2TI 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 3:12"/>Te sah ɓooɓi nik jen ŋ <char style="w" lemma="Kiristaa">Kiristaani</char> Yeesu, ɓo' nu waaɗ pes pes yurhiɗ na Kooh nga ɗah, a hey tolfiɗasse. <verse eid="2TI 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 3:13"/>Waaye ɓo' ci baahaaɗiici, leyoh ci, uupan uup diig ŋ baahaaɗi, ɓa muuƴɗe ɓinooɓi te ɓa namee muuƴɗu.<verse eid="2TI 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Njirñiŋ Fiis ci Hooliɗ ci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 3:14"/>Ini kaɗ nga ɗa, amba baahiɗ ini fu jang te fu teyɗukka ne wa in wooriɗ. Fu inhiɗ ɓi jangiɗ ɗa wa. <verse eid="2TI 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 3:15"/>Ina fu nikoh komaaki po wi, fu inhiɗ Fiis ci Hooliɗ ci ; ca miniɗ ɗa on ki'inhi na ɓaye ɗa ŋ muc, taamboh ŋ kos Kiristaani Yeesu.<verse eid="2TI 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 3:16"/>Fiis ci Hooliɗ ci jen a Kooh ɓek ca ŋ ɓi fiis ca. Ca raakiɗ njiriñ ŋ jangɗohi ca na jangɗohe keeh ki, ca teeɓohee ini nikɗi keeh, ca kuƴsee ɓoyi tumɗi baahiɗ, ca jangɗee ɓooɓi kipes yurhiɗ, <verse eid="2TI 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 3:17"/>ne ɓoyiŋ Kooh min mit te a tufuk ne a haɓiɗ panguk baahiɗ nu nik.<verse eid="2TI 3:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2TI 4"/>
  <para style="s">Pool nakohiɗ ne Woo ki yegɗohu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 4:1"/>Ŋ fiki Kooh na fiki <char style="w" lemma="Kiristaa">Kiristaani</char> Yeesu, yi atte'an pesiɗ ci na kaaniɗ ci te a yii hayis findi buur, mi yii nak ɗa inii keeh-keeh : <verse eid="2TI 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 4:2"/>Yegɗoha woo kiŋ Kooh te kinaa faɗ. Wa yooɓ, wa yooɓaaɗi, yegɗohaa. Dokna muuƴiɗ ci ŋ keeh ki, woytoha ɓi nikɗi ŋ waas, ñaaha ɓooɓi, fu jangɗee ɓa te wa hun na muñ ŋ in ci jen.<verse eid="2TI 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 4:3"/>Laam jamano hey haye wi fu inah ne ɓooɓi waaɗissanɗi kerah jangɗohi wiriɗi. Waaye ŋ ini neɓ ɓa, ɓa hey nangɗohe ɓi jangɗohoh laayiɗ ɓi na hee ɓa woye ini ɓa waaɗ kerah. <verse eid="2TI 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 4:4"/>Ɓa hey ɗikɗuke keeh ki, ɓa sikɗukee andiin. <verse eid="2TI 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 4:5"/>Waaye fu, amba haf fu ŋ in nu wa min nik ɗah, teyɗuka miskiɗ ci, yegɗoha Muci, fu mitiɗ pangki Kooh nak ɗa.<verse eid="2TI 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 4:6"/>Ini kaɗ nga so, mi yii Pool, ŋ seeƴkohuuɗ po ƴutiɗ ; te jamanooni ŋ joy kurkoh nga reyiɗ. <verse eid="2TI 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 4:7"/>Ŋ leberiɗ leberi baahiɗi, ŋ nupiɗ po ɗiska nupaahi top, ŋ ris na kosiŋ ngo. <verse eid="2TI 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 4:8"/>Ɗiski wa nik, aafiŋ ndamiŋ ngo sagu yurhi ŋ yurah wa ɗii sek ko. Heɗi, atte'ohi yurhiɗi, hey yo wa eɗe ŋ mbehaŋ atteena, te a eɗan ndo mi dong haa, waaye na ɓi waaɗ ɗe jen te ɓa sekee hayiŋ ɗe.<verse eid="2TI 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">In ci Pool nak Timoote</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 4:9"/>Ndengɗuka po fu hay yo raake ndii findi wa uup gaawoh. <verse eid="2TI 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 4:10"/>Demaas faɗiɗ to sagu waaɗ Adina, a cootiɗ Tessalonik ; Keresanse cootiɗ Galaat, Tit cootta Dalmati. <verse eid="2TI 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 4:11"/>Luk dong a yi tas na so. Ɓaya Maarko, fu hay na ɗe, a raakɗiɗ to njiriñ lool ŋ pangkiŋ ngo. <verse eid="2TI 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 4:12"/>Tisikos ŋ woos ɗe Efes. <verse eid="2TI 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 4:13"/>Fu hayee ɗah, kom mbo paltooni ŋ faɗ ŋ Torowaas, ŋ kahan Karpos, na fiis ci ; ci fiisu ŋ und, caɗ ŋ uup etoh. <verse eid="2TI 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 4:14"/>Aleksaandar tiɓohi tumiɗ to miskiɗ laayiɗ. Heɗi hey ɗe wirnde in hend na in ci a tum. <verse eid="2TI 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 4:15"/>Fu yit, wortukaa ɗe baahiɗ. A hiñohiɗ laayiɗ ini ɓoo na jangɗohe.<verse eid="2TI 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 4:16"/>Ali ɓo' ambohɗi so ŋ ngelaŋ ngo koc, ɓa jen ɓeɗ faɗ to. Kooh kinaat ɓa amboh ineem ! <verse eid="2TI 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 4:17"/>A Heɗi amboh ho, a eɗta so hatil po ŋ minnda yegɗoh woo kiŋ ɗe jen, cuuɓ ci kerahhaa. Te Heɗi mucɗiɗ to ŋ nguɓ gaynde. <verse eid="2TI 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 4:18"/>Heɗi hey yo pulɗohe ŋ in moɗaaɗi nu nik te a hey yo niiɗe po a ɓek ko ŋ Nguuriŋ ɗe ŋ ɗafka. A yi yakɗaah po faw ! Amiin !<verse eid="2TI 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Askohi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 4:19"/>Kañɗiɗ to Piriska na Akilaas na ɓi kahan Onesifoor. <verse eid="2TI 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 4:20"/>Erasta tas ŋ Korenta. Te ŋ faɗiɗ Torofiim ŋ Mileet, a kosaayee kosaay. <verse eid="2TI 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 4:21"/>Ndengɗuka fu hay bala soosi hayan ɗah. Obulos na Pudensa na Linus na Koloja na ɓaah ciŋ ɓoo kosiɗ ci jen ɓa ɗii kañiɗ ɗa. <verse eid="2TI 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 4:22"/>Heɗi niiɗaat ɗa ! A baahoh ɗu jen !<verse eid="2TI 4:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 4"/>
</usx>
